id: date/local/0001
area: date
op: Date.parse, a date-time form without an offset
in: str:"1970-01-01T12:30"
out: value: str:"1970,0,1,12,30,0,0"
class: normative
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date-time-string-format spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.parse spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-utc-t spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-localtime ref:dateref@1
script: var d = new Date("1970-01-01T12:30"); [d.getFullYear(), d.getMonth(), d.getDate(), d.getHours(), d.getMinutes(), d.getSeconds(), d.getMilliseconds()].join()
note: a local time put in and read back, at half past noon, so the outcome holds in every time zone
since: 14

