script: var d = new Date("2024-06T12:30"); [d.getFullYear(), d.getMonth(), d.getDate(), d.getHours(), d.getMinutes(), d.getSeconds(), d.getMilliseconds()].join()
note: a local time put in and read back, at half past noon, so the outcome holds in every time zone
since: 14

